     ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="tib-faq tib-section">
  <div class="tib-inner">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="tib-faq-list">

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Does it actually work? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">The principle behind Tibella &mdash; tibial nerve stimulation &mdash; is backed by 10+ published clinical trials with over 1,000 participants combined. Surface-electrode versions (what Tibella uses) have been shown to be non-inferior to the clinical needle version in multiple head-to-head studies. The principle is endorsed by the American Urological Association.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Is it safe? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Zero side effects have been reported across all published TTNS trials (Booth 2018 review, 629 patients). Tibella is non-invasive and non-pharmacological. There are no drugs entering your body.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">How is this different from a regular TENS unit? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Tibella uses a specific frequency (20 Hz), a specific pulse width (200 &micro;s), specific placement (posterior tibial nerve at the inner ankle), and a specific protocol (30-minute sessions). A back pain TENS unit doesn&rsquo;t target this nerve pathway. This is a purpose-built device for bladder control.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Will it work if medications didn&rsquo;t? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Tibella works through a completely different mechanism. Medications suppress the bladder signal with chemicals, which is why they have side effects. Tibella targets the nerve pathway directly. In the OrBIT trial, the clinical version of this technology outperformed medication (79.5% vs 54.8% improvement).</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Is it FDA-cleared? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Tibella is based on the same principle as FDA-cleared clinic devices (Urgent PC, Vivally). Consumer surface-electrode TENS devices are in a different regulatory category. The underlying science &mdash; tibial nerve stimulation &mdash; is the same.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">How long until I see results? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Studies show improvement typically beginning around 4&ndash;6 weeks with consistent use (3&ndash;4 sessions per week). Some women notice changes sooner. We recommend committing to the full 90 days &mdash; which is why we offer a 90-day guarantee.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Is it uncomfortable? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Most users describe a gentle tingling or pulsing sensation at the ankle. You control the intensity yourself across 19 levels. Start low and increase until you feel a mild tingling &mdash; that&rsquo;s the therapeutic range. Many women use it while reading, watching TV, or before bed.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Can I use it with my medications or HRT? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Yes. Tibella is non-invasive and non-pharmacological. It works alongside any existing treatment, including HRT, OAB medications, vaginal estrogen, and pelvic floor therapy. It does not interact with medications.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">Why haven&rsquo;t I heard of this before? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">PTNS (the clinical needle version) is well-known in urology clinics but has never been widely marketed to consumers. Most women only learn about it after seeing a urogynecologist &mdash; and many never get that referral. Surface-electrode home devices are newer, and the research supporting them has grown significantly in the last few years.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tib-faq-item">
        <button class="tib-faq-trigger" onclick="tibToggleFaq(this)">What if it doesn&rsquo;t work for me? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></button>
        <div class="tib-faq-body"><div class="tib-faq-body-inner">Tibella comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. No questions asked. If you use it consistently and don&rsquo;t see improvement, email us with your order number and you&rsquo;ll receive a full refund within 24 hours. We know you&rsquo;ve spent money on things that didn&rsquo;t work. That&rsquo;s why the risk is on us.</div></div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="tib-faq-final-cta">
      <a href="#tib-buybox" class="tib-btn">Get Tibella</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

